{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"37574","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:37574","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10478","characterName":"蕾米莉亚·斯卡雷特","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"蕾米莉亚·斯卡雷特","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"初登场时为500岁的萝莉吸血鬼，红魔馆女主人，像贵族般注重威严和体面，性格跟外表一样非常孩子气而任性。害怕流动的水、阳光（会变蒸气，吸到蒸气的人会长生不死）、洋葱，但不怕十字架 (因为不知道有什么好怕)。曾经为了自己方便，将幻想乡笼罩在一片红雾之中（东方红魔乡）。似乎很爱喝咲夜泡的红茶（加B型血的红茶）。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10478"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10478","value":"吸血鬼"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10478","value":"操纵命运程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f690d22104f8f111475b1447410272bb87e8f7bccce675c2c305c56607c2853f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/11010676fb7eab35e4a04aa8922af5f5f7a65a2e7771da6ad731f94b3003fe69.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10483","characterName":"幽冥楼阁的亡灵少女","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"幽冥楼阁的亡灵少女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"源远流长的西行寺家的大小姐，身为白玉楼的主人的亡灵公主。有脚的。一眼便能看出是什么都不会去想的轻浮的性格，但实际上因为已存在了一段相当长的日子，故此是有一定的知识，有时候会说出些仿佛在追寻着事物的原委般的说话，却往往是没有要点的。已成为了1000年以上的亡灵。不擅长对自己的能力没有效用的蓬莱人。是住在冥界的幽灵们的管理者。‘萃梦想’对战模式的对话中，被萃香指摘她对现世还有执念。“春雪异变”的元凶，让妖梦把“春度”收集起来，把名为“西行妖”的妖怪樱树的封印解封，使埋葬在树下的人复活。与八云紫是老朋友。生前为某“歌圣”的女儿。这个歌圣的名字没有被明确的记录下来，但在 ‘妖妖梦’中登场的和歌为“西行法师”的歌曲，再者幽幽子的姓是“西行寺”。西行寺家的古老文献中有写着“富士见之女孩”，在拥有“操纵死灵的的能力”之后便变成了“诱导别人死亡的能力”，因为厌恶简单地就能诱导人死亡的能力，与每当满开盛放时把许多人都吸引著，并成为了许多人的葬生之地，诱导别人死亡，最后化成了妖树“西行妖”的樱树。于是在“西行妖”满开之时，为了不再让“西行妖”的樱花满开，最后于树下自尽。成为亡灵后忘掉所有生前的记忆，也变得认为诱导别人死亡是一件蛮快乐的事。 (荣获第一届东方最萌冠军)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在历史上西行法师是藤原秀郷的九代孙，是藤原四大家中北家后裔，而北家开祖是藤原不比等的第二子藤原房前。若把西行寺幽幽子与藤原妹红的父亲比拟为历史人物，她们两人就有远亲关系。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483","value":"亡灵"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483","value":"操纵死亡程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e48a9da0c85b68dc9bff254c340a32988e7d433c926bf7aeb21dae10f5e26368.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b3203b696470b87edb27965ae16efb8069e69f6855d79327a84c3e8f6c3ef897.webp","width":126,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_11562","characterName":"ふじわら の もこう","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11562","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"11562","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ふじわら の もこう","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【种族】　人类（蓬莱人）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【能力】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"老いる事も死ぬ事も无い程度の能力 不老不死的程度的能力 （东方永夜抄）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"死なない程度の能力 不会死亡的程度的能力 （东方求闻史纪）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【年龄】　不老不死（至少1000岁以上）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【身高】　不明"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【职业】　不明"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【居住地】　迷途竹林深处"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【别名】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"蓬莱の人の形 蓬莱之人形 （东方永夜抄）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"焼死しない人间 烧不死的人类 （东方文花帖）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"红の自警队 红之自警队 （东方求闻史纪）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【主题曲】 月まで届け、不死の烟 （飘上月球，不死之烟）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【登场作品】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《东方永夜抄》　EX头目"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《东方文花帖》　Level EX"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【人际关系】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"藤原不比等（父亲）659年—720年，历史人物，日本奈良时期著名的公卿政治家。永夜抄/竹取物语中出现的“车持皇子”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上白泽慧音 (被守护的対象、友人)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"蓬莱山辉夜（仇敌）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"西行寺幽幽子（同为藤原氏出身：幽幽子之父佐藤义清是藤原北家秀乡流第九代，而妹红是藤原氏本家。但两人有血缘关系的可能性几乎没有。）"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11562"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/451da1a97134d5467ec8867f0ff4aed3cdce0fd43ee93daa59b2f6629e18ee7c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/64b1216b51a07538648728353ad1007ba5fe04be18d0586196bf15123a41b9e3.webp","width":152,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_11614","characterName":"幽人的庭师","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"幽人的庭师","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"西行寺行家专属庭师兼幽幽子的护卫。她是代替现时行踪不明，第一代的爷爷魂魄妖忌的第二代庭师。虽也是幽幽子的剑术指导师，但幽幽子仍是把她看作庭师来看待。所谓半人半灵，除了她本身作为“半人”的人类身体的半身，还有就是一只一直紧随她的巨大幽灵，那就是她的“半灵”的半身，也是其“魂魄”家族的共同特征 (“魂魄”家族全为半人半灵,因有半灵的关系，比一般人类长寿。并世世代代侍奉著西行寺家，其后代妖梦就是其中之一)。二刀流剑士，手上有两柄刀，拥有一挥即可杀死十来只幽灵之杀伤力的长刀“楼观剑”，和可以把人的迷惘斩断的“白楼剑”。因为性格认真又率直，常被身边的人（特别是幽幽子）捉弄。感受性很强，在‘永夜抄’的结局中，变成了狂气之眼。不擅长面对怪物等恐怖的事。 ‘文花帖（书籍）’中，也会使用了替幽幽子代管的“人魂灯”(‘香霖堂’第12话“模糊的光、窗户的雪”中登场，用作收集幽灵用的道具)，把幽灵收集。根据不同的作品，其性格也有若干的不同，性格并没有被固定起来。‘儚月抄’中那完全天然的性格与‘妖妖梦’中那种逞强的性格截然不同。‘妖妖梦’时瞳孔为红色，‘萃梦想’以后变成了青色。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11614"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11614","value":"半人半灵"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11614","value":"使用剑术程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ff2fba2e98d606edd5cabe06b21c90c3b6addfda44d96433583cf53ad55fa04b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/252c2df78fb394b8950a5fd2cac232ed665afc965fabe91aa9895c542cb3660d.webp","width":231,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_12688","characterName":"十六夜 咲夜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"十六夜 咲夜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是住在红魔馆并在里面工作的女仆。是被称之为恶魔之馆的红魔馆中唯一的人类，是女仆们的仆长。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是个在普通人类不敢接近的地方工作的不可思议的少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"没人见过她在进入红魔馆之前是怎样的。而且她对幻想乡里人类的来访极为冷淡，常站在妖怪的阵营之中。所以人们觉得她不是幻想乡的人类，有可能是外面世界或者是别的世界来的人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她没有和村落里任何人类亲近，身上含有许多谜。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不过，当她去村落买东西时，她会一脸愉快，一点也没有敌视人类的样子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12688"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12688","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12688","value":"操纵时间的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/badfc65679c51a64f83971b2fbcf3fd13d46dab33013f71db781edf64f76f640.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a45982af2e686a3ac26458362bc4b1715751ec4821b9bd2da5964412df51d2bd.webp","width":186,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_12897","characterName":"幽谷響子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12897","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"12897","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"}]},"originalCharacterName":"幽谷響子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"东方第十三作《东方神灵庙》二面道中BOSS & 二面BOSS"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"种族：山灵"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力：能够反射声音的能力"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大家在登山的时候有没有高喊过「呀喝～！」呢？如果能清晰听到「YAHOO ~！」的声音，就是妖怪山彦的杰作。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她居住在山中。只要听到哪里有愉快的喊声，她就会大声高喊回应，真是自在的妖怪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不过最近卻流行一种迷信，认为「回音（山彦）只是声波的反弹而已啦」，让她顿悟世俗的空虚而皈依佛门。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她的能力和诵经可真是如鱼得水，每天都在山里诵经。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"于是最近人们又感到害怕：「杳无人迹的深山里居然听得到诵经的声音」，总算让她保住了一点妖怪的颜面。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12897"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12897","value":"山彦"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12897","value":"反射声音的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a613ac31ffa163cc099980e39ae00735ba00045515e584a8996ba7825c55edb8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f9d841e3a6db0c397968bd8979fce5a1046fe66b3e1d5bb05498c495bfa90135.webp","width":119,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_12898","characterName":"宮古芳香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12898","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"12898","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"}]},"originalCharacterName":"宮古芳香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"被什么人复活了的神秘尸体。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作为被操纵的人偶，守护着什么重要之物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拥有异常的怪力和没有痛楚的肉体，正面相攻的话难以对付，但思考回路就如上个世纪的电脑一般，要逃走的话还是很容易的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"战斗时，她一受伤就会啃食灵魂增加体力，因而难以打倒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不过，要逃走的话还是很容易的（这点很重要）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她的身体非常坚硬，关节不会弯曲。行走不便。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其主人建议她做做柔软体操。如果柔韧性不够而去运动的话会受伤的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽说只是一只僵尸。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她究竟是在守护什么呢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"而且安排了如此没有意义的看守的，她的主人会是谁呢？"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12898"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12898","value":"僵尸"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12898","value":"什么都能吃的能力（人类如果被她啃食掉一部分身体，会暂时变成僵尸）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f98d9f70c55197fced9c021797d3a935c0de9542635781add4d171530703770d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8ce1fbe28d5fdbc130252a8107200ba5061a0dfb9d8043ab4dbdc81066244e13.webp","width":127,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20129","characterName":"超妖怪弹头","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20129","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"20129","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"20129","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"超妖怪弹头","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人气弹幕系列游戏《东方project》的主要角色。妖怪山的全能水利工程师，外貌为穿戴“太阳帽、探险制服、登山套鞋”的双马尾少女，左手拿着狗尾草，总是背着一个大包包。初次登场是在《东方风神录》。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20129"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20129","value":"河童"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20129","value":"操纵水程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/984ff1f6d554bb899d5e0bba41a209f8b0631802b21aa7b20f2abf9cb04ed3c4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cb6582adcbc425f59b1e15618739a986f9e7dd4ccbcf366fda037222ed8788cf.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20994","characterName":"栖息于淡水的人鱼","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20994","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"20994","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"栖息于淡水的人鱼","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"TH14 1面BOSS　栖息于淡水的人鱼"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若鹭姬"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Wakasagihime"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"种族：人鱼"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力：在水中就能增强实力程度的能力"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"稳重派的淡水人鱼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平常就是唱唱歌、拣拣石头过着平稳生活的妖怪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对人类也没有任何敌对心理。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"这次因为被万宝槌魔力影响，正当她变得慷慨激昂之时就被"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"灵梦等人狠狠教训了一顿。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"如今又再度变得温顺了。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20994"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20994","value":"人鱼"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20994","value":"在水中就能增强实力程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/8810ed7b45e07cd45f8f02d9a0e7539cbced4a8745ba0f128b2a40b58daab9df.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d2aca2eed7a9e973e5c3e77df02dcf1010b2db77c9faa3b8b56c9caa2b0db4b5.webp","width":194,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20995","characterName":"辘轳首的怪奇","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20995","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"20995","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"辘轳首的怪奇","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"TH14 2面BOSS　　辘轳首的怪奇"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"赤蛮奇"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sekibanki"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"种族：辘轳首"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力：让头飞出去程度的能力"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在村落里混在人类当中生活的妖怪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为能让头飞出去所以在很多时候十分方便。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格方面自尊心有点高，与人类和妖怪都没法打成一片。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"总给人一种高高在上的感觉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今年夏天，在人类的村落里由宗教家们所发起的祭典也闹了好一阵子，"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"就在人类和妖怪都欢欣雀跃之时，她却对那些流行文化抱着否定的"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"态度，一个人独自生活着。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为被万宝槌的魔力所影响，正当她洋洋自得时就被灵梦等人狠狠"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教训了一顿。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"如今又再度变得温顺了。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20995"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20995","value":"辘轳首"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20995","value":"让头飞出去程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/20288632d440ca8bbab7ccb99ce867b38699bedc46f30fc3220554663fdff6c1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/41b458f4194520856da9fe91647ccf5d7160a3425babf0a0404d7e94d72dd1ca.webp","width":131,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20996","characterName":"竹林的狼人","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20996","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"20996","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"竹林的狼人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"TH14 3面BOSS　　竹林的狼人"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今泉 影狼"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Imaizumi Kagerou"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"种族：狼女"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力：在满月之夜变身成狼程度的能力"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人性格非常沉稳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"沉稳到即使变身为狼也一样不会丧失冷静。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不知是不是因为月人在迷途的竹林里住下的缘故，"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"那里与月亮相关的妖怪似乎很多。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"而她也是其中一员。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"顺便一提，她是在外面的世界已经绝种的日本狼的狼女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为比较在意满月之夜的时候全身体毛会变多"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所以平常都遮住皮肤，一个人静静的生活。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为被万宝槌的魔力所影响，正当她变得凶暴之时就被灵梦等人"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"狠狠的教训了一顿。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"如今又再度变得温顺了。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20996"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20996","value":"狼女"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20996","value":"在满月之夜变身成狼程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b2d08d45f8cb6353a8bc049550412ae54b58de4f5c43d9d14b0a3a3bd183a09c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6f/6ff26a535504eeae42623252a6c072681cf8d590f205993e9b3b3e2cf981433c.webp","width":162,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_21002","characterName":"古琴的付丧神","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21002","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"21002","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"古琴的付丧神","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"TH14 4面boss"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"古琵琶的付丧神"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"九十九 弁弁"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tsukumo Benben"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"古琴的付丧神"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"九十九 八桥"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tsukumo Yatsuhashi"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"种族：付丧神"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力：能够自己发出声音进行演奏程度的能力"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"各自都是传统乐器的付丧神。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"扮演冷静成熟的姐姐角色的弁弁和扮演争强好胜却少根筋的妹妹角色的八桥。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"二人虽然都以姐妹相称，但其实只是因为她们是在同一时期成为付丧神而并无血缘关系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她们意识到，自身的力量之源来自于空中出现的那座逆城，于是便朝着那里前进。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她们俩的目的是让道具征服世界。也就是常说的下克上。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她们的梦想是要实现一个道具能够自由行动，能够毫无遗憾的发挥全部力量的理想乡。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但她们的梦想却受到了灵梦等人的阻挠。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但她们并没有因此而放弃。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"后来她们发现自己的那些想法是因为受到了万宝槌魔力的影响，于是她们便开始尝试"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其他可以把自己的力量置换成魔力的咒法。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21002"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21002","value":"付丧神"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21002","value":"能够自己发出声音进行演奏程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aa2d2f82622754ced053281bad28d3f820841014097342790f872ea52b494ac3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/78b2a1663c7f44b952d5a4cc0bb7cd47d5b916784a111eb3316e98d713bb1755.webp","width":227,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_21003","characterName":"逆袭的天邪鬼","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21003","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"21003","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"逆袭的天邪鬼","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"TH14 5面boss"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"鬼人 正邪"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kijin Seija"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"种族：天邪鬼"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力：能让任何事物都翻转过来程度的能力"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"企图下克上的天邪鬼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天邪鬼不属于鬼，只是一种性格扭曲的妖怪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她一天到晚脑子里总想着和其他人相反的事情。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"别人一反感她就高兴，看到别人一高兴她就开始心生厌恶。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"绝对不服从命令。就算自己赚了也绝不会把别人应得的给对方。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"这样的家伙当然会被人类、妖怪双方都厌恶，但别人越是讨厌她自然就越高兴。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"而她的野心就是把幻想乡整个翻转过来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"毁掉如今这个由强者稳定支配的幻想乡，把这里变成一个由弱者说了算"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"的世界。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"只是，她没有能够实现这个梦想的力量。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因此她就盯上了小人手上的秘宝『万宝槌』。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21003"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21003","value":"天邪鬼"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21003","value":"能让任何事物都翻转过来程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5ed5c080d839cf66ca8bdb6fdf8d7fc53a03fd359224fb0b75993649c43a10cc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fac7314156068a83b03682b5ffed88e6147b7eb62c1379139675a0ae6abb94f8.webp","width":138,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_21004","characterName":"小人的末裔","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21004","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"21004","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"小人的末裔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是一寸法师的末裔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因此能够使用万宝槌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"初代的一寸法师治退了鬼，得到了鬼的秘宝『万宝槌』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"初代获得了长大的身体和公主这些事都如同传说中所说的一样。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"除此以外再也没有使用过万宝槌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为万宝槌是鬼的法宝，由此引发的奇迹也同样来自鬼的魔力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若是随便使用必招来杀身之祸，这就是初代当时的想法。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但是，随着时代的推移一寸法师的信念逐渐被人遗忘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"然后有一天发生了这样的事件。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"分明手上就有着能够实现任何愿望的万宝槌，但却不能使用它这叫什么事情啊。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"就这样末裔中的一人，终于打破了祖先的禁忌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他用小槌的魔力穷奢极欲，终于说出了最后的愿望。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「我要建起一座豪华的城来统治人民」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一瞬间，那座名为辉针城的城就这样出现，而万宝槌的魔力也因此耗尽。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"然后，悲剧就这样发生了。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"辉针城整个逆转，城池连同小人族一起被幽闭在了鬼的世界里。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在那个世界里，没有可供其统治的人民……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"从那以后，小人族就再也不为人类所知。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"万宝槌是鬼的法宝。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"实现愿望的同时，必会给予其同等的代价。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"过于巨大的愿望，其代价可能会在愿望本身实现之前就显现。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小人族明白了这个道理。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"然后再次封印了万宝槌。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21004"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21004","value":"小人"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21004","value":"能够使用万宝槌程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7f16ba1a179bda0b357f649873f5e9937d4f6a7f8a209aadfb14f8a99097fdde.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/872ae57434677e702a0ea8914d8ff6ce9302f1739df7a271458a92f98ad248cd.webp","width":251,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_21005","characterName":"梦幻的打击乐手","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21005","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"21005","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"梦幻的打击乐手","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"TH14 EX面boss"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"堀川 雷鼓"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Horikawa Raiko"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"种族：付丧神"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力：什么都能配合上节奏程度的能力"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是和太鼓的付丧神。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在被人类敲击当中产生喜悦，生存至今。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但是，突然在身体中感受到了强烈的魔力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同时心中也涌现出了凶暴的情感。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"现在，正是道具们复仇之时。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但聪明的她，很快就发现那似乎是因为受到鬼的魔力（万宝槌的魔力）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"影响造成的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她感觉到，这样下去的话会遭其控制。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"此时她下了一个巨大的赌注。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她舍弃了作为自己身体的和太鼓，与作为魔力之源的太鼓演奏者，"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"去寻求新的魔力。而且还是在禁止进入的外面世界。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"终于，她得到了新的鼓和演奏者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"这毫无疑问，是外界的魔力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体当中已经不再残留有鬼的魔力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"这样一来即便万宝槌进入魔力的回收期，也不会再变回一般的道具了。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"于是她开始向自己周围的付丧神们到处传授这个办法。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"道具也是想以自己的意志享乐的！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"没错，来构筑一个属于道具的乐园吧！"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21005"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21005","value":"付丧神"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21005","value":"什么都能配合上节奏程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0bd434ae313f6bd65ab5d42be251a113681767750112e7014b3bb88da5c0541c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c6f9cf6475a27bbbeab691b05ab5fba43ecb04b31ed77cf64c9dd843e61bb1b5.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29664","characterName":"姬海棠羽立、姬海棠极","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29664","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"29664","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"姬海棠羽立、姬海棠极","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29664","value":"天狗"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29664","value":"能够使用念写程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/34de52f2cc67a75716f3d83cfdffa9df5a0d149e2ff60f587e0a1b10ee1ee93b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a3b11f95b7585f56e6d1308fc26286e42b75fb64f2eec30d7c38b2bcac95f16.webp","width":118,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_30146","characterName":"ふたついわ まみぞう","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"30146","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"30146","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"30146","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ふたついわ まみぞう","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"从外面的世界到来，非常稀有的妖怪狸。比起在幻想乡内独自进化的妖怪，她拥有着古典的姿态和能力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原本她似乎是妖怪狸的首领，有着相应的威严和领导风范，成为新势力的发源可能性很高。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幻想乡原本是栖息了很多妖怪狸的，所以那些野生狸或许有和外来的她联合起来互相关照的必要。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽说变身的能力就是不光是自己的姿态，是甚至可以将其他物体也变化的能力，但因为那是跟幻觉没什么分别的东西，所以她是无法制造出无中生有的幻像。无论想要欺骗谁，还是需要一个原本存在的物体的。即使那个物体在变化后也无法变成与其变化对象十分接近的物体，大概马上会被揭穿。例如说，即使狗变身成鸟，却还是不能飞翔，所以马上就会穿帮了。只是外观看上去不同，但性质是几乎没有变化的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"还有，她本人变身时多是无法藏起尾巴的。这说法基本上在全部妖怪狸、妖怪狐狸上都适用，虽然完全藏起尾巴和耳朵是不可能的，但在看不见的位置缩小或是涂上保护色之类伪装成看不见的也是可以。只不过一旦被动摇、紧张或是激动时耳朵和尾巴就会露出来，非常的显眼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"此外，尾巴的大小其实就是妖力的计量表，这大抵都是妖兽的宿命吧。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"这样的她，从最初开始就没有藏起自己尾巴的打算。说是，尾巴大是作为妖兽功力高强的缘故，这样子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有远视并且不时会皱眉头，也会用上了年纪的臭口气说话，说不定这只也是她变身出来的姿态，事实上已经非常的老迈吧（×1 妖怪狸是没有所谓正体的东西）。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30146"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/46b3fe8556c71fc8a06c1a2ea47136839b88b35a709ca6fe2f2dbc30f32fded3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/34a7ccd1bcc14388ceeeb66f23e889afd1abdf43c4cadd30f41ea9557918a55b.webp","width":119,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_485","characterName":"博麗靈夢","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1157"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"博麗靈夢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幻想乡境内博丽神社的现有巫女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"博丽神社是专门守护幻想乡不可缺少的大结界的神社。博丽的巫女代代以解决异变为事业。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是历代巫女中最缺乏危机感的一位，不知是因为修行不足，还是因为已经拥有足够的实力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她天生地幸运和敏锐，也退治了不少妖怪。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"主要是在空中飞行的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"作为博丽巫女的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"在空中飞行的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"操纵灵气的程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f33007c417ade7c73b7ee78244285c2ff601da86919605a6f56c0570deb01c0c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc26d83763ce8144e0a342eaeb5a41bf3e1756ec782d0268170ef9bac39c8489.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_486","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1157"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"霧雨魔理沙","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"居住于魔法森林的人类魔法使，常骑着扫把，「霧雨店」的独生女。會使用魔法森林的蘑菇調製火藥，所使用的魔法幾乎只有把東西破壞的效果，而且燃料需要長時間準備，但是其效果非常強力，在Spell Card規則成立下，純粹的破壞力在人類當中屬於最高等級。此外在幻想乡是出了名的小偷，帕邱莉的图书馆、香霖堂，如果不是古明地觉会读心术，甚至连地灵殿都会惨遭毒手。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486","value":"使用魔法程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e00e4df671f5f80d5733c44e4b69596b901aad88177fc335789c2dd5ea6b2d6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a3bd6c6ab5c1df20f216ccf8f7e1581841d4fed04fe2cad0f92ce726df7fb8d1.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_487","characterName":"射命丸 文","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"射命丸 文","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"射命丸文是天狗之中速度很快的鸦天狗。手持相机，在幻想乡各处奔走，记录下各种有趣的事件。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽说是鸦天狗，外表和人类并无太大差别。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"随身带着的道具是团扇、相机和文花帖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"团扇是起风的道具，一扇能刮倒屋子，二扇能刮倒大树，三扇能将旅人的斗篷吹飞。是天狗的武器。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相机是天狗的另一件武器。能将瞬间景象拍下的必杀武器（×1拍摄速度也十分地惊人。）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拍下的相片会登载在新闻报纸上。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"文花帖是将能成为新闻记事的题材记录起来的天狗的笔记本。里面混杂了各种相片和手写文字（×2天狗的手写体意外地可爱。）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"操纵风的能力，指的是既能瞬间吹起狂风又能瞬间让狂风停止，还能肆意刮起龙卷风，纯粹追求强力的猛烈技能。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"487"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"487","value":"鸦天狗（花映冢、风神录、绯想天）/天狗（地灵殿、求闻史纪、天空璋）"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"487","value":"操纵风程度的能力（花映冢、风神录、绯想天、地灵殿、求闻史纪、天空璋）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76964ca8ed3f6929b65c57aee506edb84d82d9d95c36aa5803ddc89f98434a70.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5c30a2767989de1befcc33502cf3697399f51b28cb405e96be8425b397255b10.webp","width":161,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_889","characterName":"東風谷 早苗","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"889","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"東風谷 早苗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"住在妖怪之山上的守矢神社的巫女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"889"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"889","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"889","value":"引发奇迹程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b1c4cec24100603ccda5fb96eda4303e1cc0ee88841ee32d35f05a2905a1efd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/46d80e50773b6c9b14e3ada0d949ea2c94dd248ab95c87a252bcd67ab59d5f22.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_890","characterName":"湖上的冰精","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"湖上的冰精","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"在雾之湖的附近，即使是夏天也会出现极端低温。这时候常能遇到的妖精就是冰之妖精。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是湖附近妖精们中的领袖般的存在，力量也比其他妖精强。她是属于好战型的，所以必须留神。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她身高颇低，穿蓝色的衣服，背后有冰之羽翼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她有操控冷气的能力。能瞬间冻结小东西，比普通的妖精更危险。一直在释放冷气的她周围总是很寒冷。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人们不知道她住在哪里，也无法得知她平时的生活是怎样的。不光是琪露诺，所有的妖精都能溶入大自然之中，所以人类们看不见。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"890"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"890","value":"妖精"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"890","value":"操控冷气程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25af4f6889a331e39b0794d719a1f9518b4db2435d771266f0facafae6918544.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bbae3be8cbaf201d20a01a4252681feb495db0eacefea46e8410e4782bb64341.webp","width":180,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:997","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:997","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:997","name":"上海アリス幻樂団","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-brand:37574:997","source":"egs"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","current-runtime-cover-unavailable","egs-creator-credit-missing","vndb-work-mapping-pending"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
